# Backend API Configuration
# ============================================
# AUTOMATIC FALLBACK ENABLED (Recommended)
# ============================================
# Leave VITE_API_URL commented out for automatic fallback:
# - Tries localhost:5001 first (2-second timeout)
# - Falls back to production if localhost unavailable
# - Works seamlessly in all environments
#
# VITE_API_URL=

# ============================================
# MANUAL OVERRIDE OPTIONS
# ============================================
# Option 1: Force localhost (for development)
# VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:5001

# Option 2: Force production (for testing production API locally)
# VITE_API_URL=https://adzu-sdu-backend.vercel.app

# ============================================
# CURRENT CONFIGURATION
# ============================================
# Uncomment to override automatic fallback:
